<title>UK: Wardle Storeys year pretax profit up 47 pct.</title>
<headline>Wardle Storeys year pretax profit up 47 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to August 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 27.2		  vs 18.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  13.0		  vs 12.25</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  19.0		  vs 17.25</p>
<p> Pretax			10.5		  vs  7.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   110.4		  vs 94.9</p>
<p> Operating profit	  9.8		   vs  5.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Specialised plastics group Wardle Storeys Plc said it believes it now has the capability to deliver significant and sustained medium term growth in operating profit, earnings and dividends.  Tax			  2.2		    vs 2.46</p>
<p>Pay date		   Jan 6, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Nov 26</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
